<p class="sb-kicker">DAILY TRIVIA / BROWSER GAME</p>
<h1>Boreen: <span>Player Guide</span></h1>
<p class="sb-deck">Think beyond the obvious. Travel further.</p>
<p class="sb-lead">Boreen is a free daily trivia game where knowing the right answer is only half the challenge. The goal is to find correct answers that other players are less likely to think of, earning animal sightings and travelling further along a daily route.</p>
<p class="sb-lead">Originally created as an Irish knowledge quiz, Boreen now has separate editions for Ireland, England and Scotland, each with its own questions, animals and landmarks.</p>
<p class="sb-lead">This guide explains how to play, how the scoring system works, how to improve your daily results and what to do when an answer doesn't count.</p>
<ul class="sb-facts"><li>Daily Trivia · Browser Game</li><li>Desktop · Mobile · Tablet</li><li>Free to Play</li><li>Oisín McKnight</li></ul>
<div class="sb-actions"><a class="sb-primary" href="https://boreen.ie/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Play Boreen Ireland <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="sb-primary" href="https://boreen.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Play Boreen England <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="sb-primary" href="https://boreen.scot/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Play Boreen Scotland <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</div></div></section>
